WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.470
Another day with no progress.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.510
SOMEWHERE IN TOKYO

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.220
I think it's about time
he showed me his face.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.600
Hey, you ought to open the window
for ventilation sometimes.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.270
Fusui, how's it going?

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.320
Oh, hey, Henzo. You're back.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.530
-I brought you some food.
-Thanks!

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.530
Thinking about the tournament...

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:36.740
HENZO KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.910
...the match should be
starting about now.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.080
Are you curious about it?

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.580
Of course I am.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.420
Mainly because, you know,
our representative is that Raian.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.300
Why him, of all the people in our family?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.220
-Oh, sorry!
-Never mind.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.890
I know how crazy my big brother is.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:58.800
Whatever people say,
he probably deserves it.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.260
FUSUI KURE
RAIAN'S YOUNGER SISTER

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:03.430
You think so? That sounds pretty cold.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.900
But I do wonder what Grandpa is thinking.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.860
Why does he want us
to monitor our client?

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.400
Yeah, it's weird.

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.240
Well, have you found anything?

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:19.200
We've been on a stakeout for four days
and the target hasn't shown himself once.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:23.540
He must be in that room, though.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.080
KENZO YAMASHITA, KAZUO'S OLDEST SON
REAL PRESIDENT OF UNDER MOUNT INC

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.880
<i>Is everyone having a good time?</i>

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:33.920
<i>Please wait just a little longer</i>

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.430
<i>for the third game</i>
<i>of the first round to start.</i>

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:40.550
In the next match, we'll finally
see the Kure Family's fighter.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:44.930
The winner of this game is going to be
Ohma's opponent in the next round.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:46.690
K. AKIYAMA, NOGI
K. YAMASHITA, YAMASHITA

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.060
We can't miss this match, Ohma...

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.190
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.570
The match could start at any moment,

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.400
where the hell is Raian?

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.070
MASAHIKO OHTA
PRESIDENT, UNDER MOUNT INC

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.450
I'm finally feeling better.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.450
LIHITO
FIGHTER & PRESIDENT,SH FROZEN STORAGE

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.410
I guess I drank too much last night.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.830
Looks like you've been
having a good time, man.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.500
RAIAN KURE
FIGHTER, UNDER MOUNT INC

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.130
-<i>This guy's from the Kure Family!</i>
-So active, aren't you?

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.550
What the hell? What's wrong with you?
Get the hell off of me!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.180
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:24.890
Isn't it obvious?

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.190
I'm fucking with you,
self-proclaimed "Super Human".

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.440
I bet you're already aware

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:40.030
that there's no place for a normy
like you in this tournament.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.410
Okay. I see what you're getting at.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.290
You'll be dropping out soon.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.040
I'm going to be the one dropping out?
Seriously?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:53.090
Does this mean
you're picking a fight with me?

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.550
Damn right, you fool!
I won't let you take that back!

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.180
Ladies and gentlemen,
thank you for your patience.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.980
SAYAKA KATAHARA
DAUGHTER OF METSUDO KATAHARA

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.230
Now, please welcome the fighters.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.320
Hey.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.820
-Is it my turn?
-Raian, you made it!

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.580
<i>The troublemaker of the assassin clan...</i>

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.870
GAME THREE

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.960
<i>...breaks into the tournament.</i>

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:35.630
<i>In the name of the Kure Family,</i>
<i>he'll kill anyone who stands in his way.</i>

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.920
<i>Standing 188 centimeters tall</i>
<i>and weighing 94 kilos,</i>

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.840
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:48.640
Representing Under Mount Inc,
also known as "The Taboo Descendant,"

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.810
Raian Kure!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.950
Hey, do you see that?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.120
Why on earth is he covered in blood?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.750
Stop making a big deal
out of everything, you pigs.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.000
What... the hell?

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.000
NAOYA OHKUBO
FIGHTER, MUJI TELEVISION NETWORK

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.590
Goddamn it!

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:22.550
RYO HIMURO, SUEKICHI KANEDA
EX & CURRENT GINOKUNIYA BOOKSHOP FIGHTERS

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.180
-What happened?
-Raian beat Lihito up--

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.390
He didn't!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.220
Yes, he totally did.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:05.940
"SISTER"

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.570
Brother, please stay safe.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.660
ELENA ROBINSON
YOUNGER SISTER OF MOKICHI ROBINSON

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.750
MOKICHI ROBINSON
FIGHTER, SENTORY

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:16.750
Thank you, Elena.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.460
All right. I'm off to the match.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.590
<i>Now, please welcome his opponent.</i>

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:31.640
<i>This fighter was reverse-imported</i>
<i>from the UK.</i>

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:36.600
<i>His blue eyes are fixed only on victory.</i>

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.900
<i>With God's protection,</i>
<i>the holy warrior makes a sortie.</i>

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:45.150
<i>Standing 189 centimeters tall</i>
<i>and weighing 99 kilos,</i>

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:49.240
<i>his kengan record is</i>
<i>48 wins and no losses.</i>

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:54.700
His net worth is 708 billion, 834 million,
900 thousand yen.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:59.500
Representing Sentory,
also known as "The Exterminating Vicar,"

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.840
Mokichi Robinson!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:13.850
Mokichi! Mokichi! Mokichi!

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.770
<i>Elena, you're my everything.</i>

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.560
<i>For you,</i>
<i>I can be as strong as I need to be.</i>

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.230
<i>If you wish,</i>

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.530
<i>I will beat even God.</i>

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:34.410
Mokichi! Mokichi! Mokichi!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.830
Mokichi! Mokichi!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.500
There he is!

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.790
ERIO KURE
KURE FAMILY PATRIARCH

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.080
METSUDO KATAHARA
KENGAN CHAIRMAN

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.540
It seems that the young man is
one of your favorite fighters.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:53.550
Erio, I know you set
a high value on Raian,

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:57.010
but this battle may not go as you think.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:02.690
Fighting runs in their blood, you know.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.900
-Blood, you say?
-Indeed.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.570
Mokichi Robinson...

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:15.660
He benefits from what he has inherited,
just as you do in the Kure Family.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:19.700
So, the blood of their lineage
is at stake in this battle, is it?

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:24.460
You are correct. This is not merely
a battle between two fighters.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:29.880
It is a battle which will determine
whose blood will survive.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.010
<i>It's now time for the battle between</i>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.880
<i>the elite assassin</i>
<i>and the reverse-imported fighter.</i>

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:39.350
<i>They're silently glaring at each other</i>
<i>before the match.</i>

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.720
Take your stance.

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.810
Fight!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.610
Not bad.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:57.910
<i>Wow! They're exchanging intense blows</i>
<i>right off the bat!</i>

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.040
<i>Go for it, Brother.</i>

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.250
T. HASHIDA, SENTORY

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:04.290
<i>We got this, Mokichi.</i>

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.920
Is he really going to be all right?

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.960
Oh, boy. Raian is just playing with him.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:11.460
He's incorrigible.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.550
REICHI KURE, HORIO KURE & HOLLIS KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:17.180
Actually, he's not the only one
who hasn't gotten serious yet.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.930
<i>Neither of them is giving an inch.</i>

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.600
<i>You can't take your eyes off</i>
<i>this match for a second!</i>

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.650
<i>It's fun to play with this limey jerk.</i>

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.820
<i>Now, how about this?</i>

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:43.450
-What was that?
-He blinded him using his own blood.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.170
Though he's not on my side,
I must admit that he's doing well.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.470
Does that young man
practice classical jujitsu?

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.430
In the moment of attack,
he got him in hold.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.470
<i>There are differences</i>

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.520
<i>between modern combat sports</i>
<i>and classical martial arts.</i>

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.390
<i>One of them uses fingers.</i>

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.400
<i>Fingers are used all the time...</i>

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.400
LOCK

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.070
<i>...in every situation during a battle.</i>

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.150
DISLOCATE

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.990
<i>Having your fingers broken</i>
<i>means inevitable defeat.</i>

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:18.070
BREAK

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.870
I give it a little twist here and...

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.450
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.170
He gets perfect points.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.090
SUKIZO URITA
PRESIDENT, PENASONIC CORP.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.460
That priest is pretty strong.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.470
RYO INABA
FIGHTER, PENASONIC CORPORATION

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.720
It might mean trouble
if he makes it to the later stages.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.350
It would not be difficult for me
to break your fingers now.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:48.230
Do you want to continue, man of Kure?

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.690
You bastard!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.860
Just kidding.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.780
Don't think you can beat me
with little tricks like that.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:03.740
-Wow. He broke free from the hold.
-Of course he did.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:08.910
The Kure Family have lived as warriors
for 1,300 years, since the 8th century.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:13.630
During that time we've married
the daughters of renowned martial artists,

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:17.010
at other times we've introduced
excellent seed from the outside.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:22.430
<i>Through selective breeding and adoption</i>
<i>of special techniques over the centuries,</i>

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:28.600
<i>the Kure Family has become</i>
<i>a race specialized for battle.</i>

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.770
<i>We evolve day by day.</i>

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.900
There is no technique in this world
that the Kure Family cannot overcome.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:43.070
Did you think you had me?
Did you really think you could beat me?

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:47.660
Did you enjoy dreaming, dumb-ass?

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:50.580
Dream, huh?

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:55.000
Then I'll make this dream come true.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.430
Did you really think you could beat me?

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:11.020
Did you enjoy dreaming, dumb-ass?

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.070
<i>What are you going to do, jujitsu dipshit?</i>

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.860
<i>Are you going to dodge it? Receive it?</i>

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.490
What?

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.740
Was that a short uppercut?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:32.370
<i>That isn't a classical martial arts move.</i>

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.250
<i>That footwork...</i>

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.500
<i>Is that boxing?</i>

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:44.630
<i>What kind of move was that?</i>
<i>I've never seen this style before.</i>

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:49.390
Mokichi Robinson uses
a unique fighting style.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.560
It's Baritsu.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.100
<i>In the late shogunate period</i>
<i>in the 19th century,</i>

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.270
<i>kengan matches were dominated</i>
<i>by one fighter.</i>

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:02.280
<i>This man took techniques from other styles</i>

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.280
<i>and incorporated them</i>
<i>into classical martial arts.</i>

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:08.120
<i>His name was Shigenosuke Kotoura,</i>
<i>the master of the Musen Style.</i>

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.660
<i>He was one of the ten most extraordinary</i>
<i>warriors of the era.</i>

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.790
<i>This legendary fighter was known</i>
<i>as the Mythical Technician.</i>

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.550
<i>He left Japan in search of mightier</i>
<i>adversaries in the British Empire,</i>

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:25.590
<i>where combat sports</i>
<i>were thriving at the time.</i>

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:30.600
<i>By combining western martial arts with</i>
<i>classical martial arts and jujitsu,</i>

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:33.470
<i>he established his own style.</i>

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.940
<i>That is the unique combat sport,</i>

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:39.610
<i>the so-called Baritsu.</i>

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.610
I see. The man we are watching
is the descendant of Shigenosuke.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:44.650
That's right.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.240
That's who Mokichi Robinson is.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:53.790
<i>Shit.</i>

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:00.040
Full Shoulder Throw!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.050
Please forgive me.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.720
You were so strong
that I couldn't go easy on you.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:18.140
He has failed me!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:23.360
Goddamn Raian. You fool!

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:27.030
Dude. Raian lost as I expected he would.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.610
This is unbelievable.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.580
Uncle Horio, Reichi, brace yourselves.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.540
This is not a fight anymore.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.170
<i>My throw was perfect.</i>

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.920
<i>How was he able to get back up?</i>

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.470
That's it!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.550
That was the way he beat me!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.850
No way. Is he actually going to use that

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:58.180
in front of all those people? It's what
makes the Kure Family what it is.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.350
R. KURAYOSHI & R. MIKAZUCHI

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.060
<i>The secret technique: Removal.</i>

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.270
That bastard!

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:09.360
How dare he use our family's secret
technique in public without my permission!

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:15.990
I don't give a shit about fights.
I'm not interested in the outcome.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.910
Do you know what I like?

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.500
I like total domination!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.670
Especially through one-sided violence.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:29.010
Now, it's time to dominate you.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.260
<i>How strange.</i>

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.850
<i>He looks like a totally different man.</i>

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:38.810
Are you ready?
Keep your eyes open.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.270
Mokichi!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.080
His movements have completely changed.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:16:00.040
Mr. Yamashita, doesn't this
remind you of something?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.540
<i>It does look exactly like that.</i>

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.340
<i>But it can't be the same.</i>

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:12.050
<i>Raian's form...</i>
<i>is different to what Ohma's was.</i>

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:19.680
Normally, we humans can use only
30 percent of our physical capabilities.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:26.360
<i>The brain restrains it to protect our</i>
<i>bodies from breaking due to over-exertion.</i>

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.480
<i>However, improvements arising</i>
<i>from years of selective breeding,</i>

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.780
<i>means that our clan now have constitutions</i>
<i>which can withstand this surge in power.</i>

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:38.160
<i>By removing the limit, we've obtained the</i>
<i>overwhelming strength of the gods.</i>

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.290
<i>That's the Kure Family's secret technique,</i>

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.250
<i>Removal of restraint.</i>

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:50.000
<i>The maximum latent power we can remove</i>
<i>varies based on the individual's ability.</i>

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:54.260
Raian is able to access
100 percent of his latent power.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.430
<i>Whoa! Raian threw Mokichi!</i>

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:02.680
<i>What a throw.</i>

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.270
I lift you up...
and then I slam you down.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.730
That's enough! Please stop it.

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:14.610
Why would I stop?

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:18.740
<i>Raian's strangling Mokichi.</i>

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:21.200
This is truly simple and truly cruel.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:26.000
<i>Will Mokichi manage to escape?</i>
<i>Or is he going to black out?</i>

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:30.920
No way. He's dealing with Mokichi
as easily as if he was a child.

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.260
Wh-- What's going on?

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.760
<i>It's brutal!</i>

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:41.260
<i>You call that a punch?</i>

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.270
<i>A fly could have a rest on your arm.</i>

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.600
<i>Get up, wimp!</i>

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.190
<i>Do you really think you will</i>
<i>ever be able to surpass me?</i>

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:54.110
<i>I hated my father.</i>

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.450
<i>Screw Baritsu!</i>

00:17:56.780 --> 00:18:00.490
<i>I don't need</i>
<i>your old-fashioned martial art.</i>

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:04.870
<i>I left home when I was 14.</i>

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.120
<i>I dived into the criminal underworld,</i>

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:11.880
<i>and indulged all kinds</i>
<i>of vice using Baritsu.</i>

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:15.920
<i>It was a sort of revenge for the pressure</i>
<i>my bloodline had placed upon me.</i>

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.550
<i>But actually, I was only</i>
<i>pretending to be free.</i>

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.100
<i>My life had no meaning or value at all.</i>

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:30.310
<i>But you were the one</i>
<i>who changed me... Elena.</i>

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.520
<i>You're Mokichi, right?</i>

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:38.360
<i>Before he passed away, your father</i>
<i>asked me to take care of you both</i>

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.030
<i>This is Elena Robinson.</i>

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:45.290
<i>-She's your half-sister.</i>
<i>-My sister?</i>

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.540
<i>Elena, thanks to you,</i>
<i>I got back on my feet.</i>

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:58.050
<i>Thanks to you,</i>
<i>I learned how precious family is.</i>

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:09.640
<i>Nice job! Mokichi succeeded in escaping!</i>

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:19.780
<i>Mokichi, please stop now.</i>

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.870
<i>I don't care if you lose</i>
<i>as long as you survive!</i>

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.540
<i>Huh? You want to know the reason I fight?</i>

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:32.630
<i>It's so that I am strong</i>
<i>enough to protect you.</i>

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:37.250
<i>You are the most important person</i>
<i>in the world to me, Elena.</i>

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:49.730
<i>All I can do is believe in my brother.</i>

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:55.110
Don't lose, Mokichi!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.610
<i>Thank you, Elena.</i>

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:05.410
<i>Even if I kill myself, I'll protect you.</i>

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>And to protect our bloodline,</i>

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.790
<i>I will not fail to secure victory.</i>

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.040
<i>Now, taste this, Kure Family.</i>

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.880
<i>The secret technique of Baritsu,</i>
<i>Two-Finger.</i>

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:31.430
I was just getting serious
and this is all you have?

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.480
You thought you could match me?

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:40.780
I don't give a shit

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:43.450
about this tournament,

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.450
the schemes of those old men,

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.700
you fighters,

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.660
<i>or any other pigs!</i>

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.960
There's only one thing I want to do.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:57.590
I'm going to kill you all!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.170
First one down.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:05.180
Damn you...

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:14.980
Brother!

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.940
That's enough!

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:27.530
<i>No.</i>

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.660
<i>He just died.</i>

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.540
<i>A man's life ends so easily?</i>

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:41.960
KARURA KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.840
What's up, suckers?

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.300
Why are you so quiet?

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:50.180
Didn't you come to see...

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:53.350
the moment that people die?

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:59.560
Because this is literally
the "Life-or-Death" tournament!

00:22:03.030 --> 00:22:03.940
<i>Erio.</i>

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.820
He is...

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:09.410
Raian is irregular,
even among the Kure Family.

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:12.280
He's a demon who slaughters
as many people as he wants.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:17.080
It is simply impossible
to keep him in line.

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:21.000
Are you watching, guys?

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.920
Now you all know that I'm...

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:27.970
the strongest!

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.940
PREVIEW

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:08.530
<i>Step by step,</i>

00:24:08.650 --> 00:24:11.450
<i>an assassin from the darkness</i>
<i>is creeping up on the Ashura.</i>

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:14.370
<i>He's tiny but strong!</i>

00:24:14.450 --> 00:24:17.740
<i>Ohma Tokita's first match</i>
<i>will be fierce and bizarre.</i>

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:18.830
<i>Get excited for it!</i>

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:19.910
<i>Next episode: "Ashura."</i>

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.500
Subtitle translation by
Miki Miyaji
